    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>武器屋「ティーゼル」よぉ♪
ほしいものあるぅ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're the weapon shop, "Teisel"~ ♪
There anything you're looking for~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手になじむ武具、
あったぁ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Any o' the gear
suit your fancy~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何よ、みんな、&lt;Mint&gt;&lt;Mint&gt;って
あんなのちょっと
カワイイだけじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why's everyone keep talking about
&lt;Mint&gt;? Sure, she's kind of cute, but
that's her only good point, really, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>胸がでかくて……
キーーーー悔しい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And those huge things on her
chest... Gyaaahh! It's so unfair!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>男に頼るだけしか能のない、
つまんない女よね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Her only "talent" is relying on men!
What's so great about a girl like that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>男はどうしてあんなのが
好きなのかしら……ふん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What do men even like about
girls like that...? Hmph...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mint&gt;ってむかつくわ。
もともとこの村の人間でも
ないのに急にやって来て……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mint&gt; is just so irritating. She's not
even *from* this village, but she
moved in all of a sudden, and then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そもそも
&lt;Cless&gt;に最初に目つけたの
私の方が先だっての</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And anyway, it's all about
finders keepers, so I should
get first dibs on &lt;Cless&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Chester&gt;も&lt;Chester&gt;だわ
私と&lt;Cless&gt;のこと応援するって
言ってたくせに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And even &lt;Chester&gt;. He
said he was all for me
and &lt;Cless&gt;, and yet...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうせ&lt;Chester&gt;もあの女に
うまく丸め込まれたんだわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In any case, she's probably
got &lt;Chester&gt; in her pocket, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このあいだ、&lt;Mint&gt;と話したわ……
何よ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just the other day, I spoke to &lt;Mint&gt;...
And I, just... What in the world...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いいやつじゃない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...She's so nice...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Could phrase it as "She's a nice girl, isn't she..."</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269792</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の&lt;Cless&gt;をとったのは
許せないけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm still upset she took
&lt;Cless&gt; from me, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269792</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ま、いいわ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh well...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
